a3e6-543d-8e99-d1193eb9a100'}, {'abstract': 'It took me a long time to find a new home for the belongings he left behind.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/01/opinion/sunday/death-husband-grief.html', 'snippet': 'It took me a long time to find a new home for the belongings he left behind.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PHOENIX — My husband and I shared a narrow, shoebox-shaped closet in our home here, his clothes facing mine from double-hanging wardrobes mounted on the walls. After he died of pancreatic cancer on Nov. 1, 2017, a month after his diagnosis, I’d often wander into the closet to search for his smell on his shirts. My mother caught me one day sniffing his shirts and crying, and said, “You can’t keep doing this forever.”', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/03/opinion/sunday/03santos/03santos-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 697, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/03/opinion/sunday/03santos/03santos-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 697}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/03/opinion/sunday/03santos/03santos-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 882, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/03/opinion/sunday/03santos/03santos-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1764, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/03/opinion/sunday/03santos/03santos-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/03/o