, Leicester has remade itself by gently casting off its heroes in favor of young talents.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The tears, for Danny Simpson, started to flow in the changing room, as he said goodbye to the club he had called home for five years, the club he had helped make improbable history. In a way — the nicest possible way — that is just how Leicester City had wanted it.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/03/sports/03onsoccer-leicesterweb1/merlin_163331178_57c4d185-9fde-464f-a487-a480dd86b67f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/03/sports/03onsoccer-leicesterweb1/merlin_163331178_57c4d185-9fde-464f-a487-a480dd86b67f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/03/sports/03onsoccer-leicesterweb1/merlin_163331178_57c4d185-9fde-464f-a487-a480dd86b67f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/03/sports/03onsoccer-leicesterweb1/merlin_163331178_57c4d185-9fde-464f-a487-a480dd86b67f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/03/sports/03onsoccer-leicesterweb1/03onsoccer-leicesterweb1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/03/sports/03onsoccer-leicesterweb1/03onsoccer-leicesterweb1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank'