or promoting unattainable standards. Now we blame one another. The pressure to be “real” is too much.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/02/opinion/sunday/instagram-social-media.html', 'snippet': 'Women used to blame magazines for promoting unattainable standards. Now we blame one another. The pressure to be “real” is too much.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Recently, a friend told me she was taking a break from Instagram in part because her female co-workers reacted with snark and envy to her vacation photos. “Some of these women are haters,” jealous of “the fact that I travel and do fun things,” she explained. But, she added, “It’s not like it hasn’t come at a cost.” ', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/03/opinion/sunday/03marikar/03marikar-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 650, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/03/opinion/sunday/03marikar/03marikar-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 650}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/03/opinion/sunday/03marikar/03marikar-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 946, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/03/opinion/sunday/03marikar/03marikar-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1891, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/03/opinion/sunday/03marikar/03marikar-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/03/opinion/sunday/03marikar/03marikar-thumbStandard.jpg',