s at the White House. But at least one star will stay away.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/02/us/politics/trump-washington-nationals.html', 'snippet': 'A week after he was greeted by “lock him up” chants at Nationals Park, President Trump will host the World Series champions at the White House. But at least one star will stay away.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — For once, President Trump is showing no hard feelings. A week after being booed at Nationals Park, the president will host the Washington Nationals at the White House on Monday to celebrate an improbable come-from-behind World Series victory that has united an otherwise polarized nation’s capital.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/02/us/02dc-nationals/merlin_163450221_c00637e4-6bd0-4b67-8400-c590604a13c0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 395, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/02/us/02dc-nationals/merlin_163450221_c00637e4-6bd0-4b67-8400-c590604a13c0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 395}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/02/us/02dc-nationals/merlin_163450221_c00637e4-6bd0-4b67-8400-c590604a13c0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 674, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/02/us/02dc-nationals/merlin_163450221_c00637e4-6bd0-4b67-8400-c590604a13c0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1347, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/02/us/02dc-nationals/merlin_163450221_c00637e4-6bd0-4b67-8400-c590604a13c0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subTy