ver get produced. That would be worth it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/02/opinion/sunday/pelosi-drug-prices-plan.html', 'snippet': 'Under a new bill, a handful of new drugs might never get produced. That would be worth it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A bill now making its way through the House could finally provide relief from the sky-high drug prices that have become a hallmark of the American health care industry. But to get there, Americans will need to accept a trade-off that other advanced nations have long since come around to: Slightly fewer new drugs will come to market, in exchange for better prices on the medications that already exist.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/02/opinion/02drugpricing/02drugpricing-articleLarge-v6.jpg', 'height': 608, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/02/opinion/02drugpricing/02drugpricing-articleLarge-v6.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 608}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/02/opinion/02drugpricing/02drugpricing-jumbo-v6.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1011, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/02/opinion/02drugpricing/02drugpricing-superJumbo-v6.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2021, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/02/opinion/02drugpricing/02drugpricing-thumbStandard-v6.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/02/opinion/02drugpricing/02drugpricing-thumbStanda