i': 'nyt://article/eb569098-49d9-5737-b5e1-c0cfe0774959'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Schiff leads the impeachment inquiry into President Trump. Depending on one’s viewpoint, he will either save the republic — or destroy it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/03/us/politics/adam-schiff-trump-impeachment.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Schiff leads the impeachment inquiry into President Trump. Depending on one’s viewpoint, he will either save the republic — or destroy it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — The crowd was buzzing with Hollywood types — the actress Patricia Arquette, the producer Norman Lear — at a private film screening on Sunset Boulevard one recent Sunday afternoon. But here in liberal America, the biggest celebrity in the room was not someone who makes a living in what people call “the industry.” ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/01/us/politics/03dc-schiff1/merlin_162693621_65cd832e-f5f3-4090-ad3a-7cc45b1c6065-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/01/us/politics/03dc-schiff1/merlin_162693621_65cd832e-f5f3-4090-ad3a-7cc45b1c6065-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/01/us/politics/03dc-schiff1/merlin_162693621_65cd832e-f5f3-4090-ad3a-7cc45b1c6065-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/01/us/politics/03dc-schiff1/merlin_162693621_65cd832e-f5f3-4090-ad3a-7cc45b1c6065-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbn