'}, {'abstract': 'Sarah Miller’s “The Miracle and Tragedy of the Dionne Quintuplets” captures the sad situation of five little girls who became a Depression-era spectacle.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/04/books/review/the-miracle-and-tragedy-of-the-dionne-quintuplets-sarah-miller.html', 'snippet': 'Sarah Miller’s “The Miracle and Tragedy of the Dionne Quintuplets” captures the sad situation of five little girls who became a Depression-era spectacle.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Once upon a time, five identical little girls in pretty matching dresses with bobbing brown ringlets played for an audience who watched them through windows. They were a miracle, an escape, a yearned-for fairy tale in a time when people faced the harsh realities of the Great Depression.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/10/books/review/10-BKS-WALKER/10-BKS-WALKER-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/10/books/review/10-BKS-WALKER/10-BKS-WALKER-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/10/books/review/10-BKS-WALKER/10-BKS-WALKER-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/10/books/review/10-BKS-WALKER/10-BKS-WALKER-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/10/books/review/10-BKS-WALKER/10-BKS-WALKER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType'