an.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/04/movies/linda-hamilton-on-james-cameron-and-the-first-terminator-films.html', 'snippet': 'The actress recalls an explosive confrontation when she demanded he treat her like a human.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The new film “Terminator: Dark Fate” brings Linda Hamilton back to her signature role of Sarah Connor for the first time since  1991, when “Terminator 2: Judgment Day” made her a pop-culture icon. In a previous interview, Hamilton discussed what it was like to step back into the spotlight after starting her life anew in New Orleans, but she had lots more to say about making that decision, her history with the “Terminator” franchise, and her marriage to the director of the first two films, James Cameron. Here are more edited excerpts from that conversation.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/01/arts/01linda-hamilton-outtakes/merlin_159213609_423c837b-521d-4d72-bf9e-35031806e2af-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 736, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/01/arts/01linda-hamilton-outtakes/merlin_159213609_423c837b-521d-4d72-bf9e-35031806e2af-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 736}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/01/arts/01linda-hamilton-outtakes/merlin_159213609_423c837b-521d-4d72-bf9e-35031806e2af-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 836, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/01/arts/01linda-hamilton-outtakes/merlin_159213609_423c837b-521d-4d72-bf9e-35031806e2af-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1671, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': No