s and institutions like hospitals, he is starting to place them in public locations, like building lobbies, and expects to have 100 in Manhattan and New Jersey by the end of the year.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/06/dining/04burner6/merlin_163608750_5ba892f4-1143-4ed6-aa30-5e9c6c839536-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 467, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/06/dining/04burner6/merlin_163608750_5ba892f4-1143-4ed6-aa30-5e9c6c839536-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 467}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/06/dining/04burner6/merlin_163608750_5ba892f4-1143-4ed6-aa30-5e9c6c839536-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 798, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/06/dining/04burner6/merlin_163608750_5ba892f4-1143-4ed6-aa30-5e9c6c839536-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1595, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/06/dining/04burner6/merlin_163608750_5ba892f4-1143-4ed6-aa30-5e9c6c839536-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/06/dining/04burner6/merlin_163608750_5ba892f4-1143-4ed6-aa30-5e9c6c839536-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/06/dining/04burner6/merlin_163608750_5ba892f4-1143-4ed6-aa30-5e9c6c839536-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'su