Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/dba89a33-41cf-5245-903f-0858fd37d3c0', 'word_count': 895, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dba89a33-41cf-5245-903f-0858fd37d3c0'}, {'abstract': 'Cinema is an art form that brings you the unexpected. In superhero movies, nothing is at risk, a director says.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/04/opinion/martin-scorsese-marvel.html', 'snippet': 'Cinema is an art form that brings you the unexpected. In superhero movies, nothing is at risk, a director says.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When I was in England in early October, I gave an interview to Empire magazine. I was asked a question about Marvel movies. I answered it. I said that I’ve tried to watch a few of them and that they’re not for me, that they seem to me to be closer to theme parks than they are to movies as I’ve known and loved them throughout my life, and that in the end, I don’t think they’re cinema.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/06/opinion/04scorsese/04scorsese-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 348, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/06/opinion/04scorsese/04scorsese-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 348}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/06/opinion/04scorsese/04scorsese-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 594, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/06/opinion/04scorsese/04scorsese-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1188, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/06/opinion/04scorsese/04scorsese-thumbSta