ned to restaurants on Sunday after a hiatus.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/05/us/popeyes-stabbing-oxon-hill.html', 'snippet': 'Moments after cutting a line for customers ordering the new sandwich, the victim was stabbed in the upper body, the police said. The popular sandwich returned to restaurants on Sunday after a hiatus.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The authorities are searching for an unidentified man who they say fatally stabbed another man in an altercation while waiting for the new Popeyes chicken sandwich in Maryland on Monday night. The police are also searching for a woman who is wanted for questioning.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/06/multimedia/05xp-popeyes2/05xp-popeyes2-articleLarge.png', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/06/multimedia/05xp-popeyes2/05xp-popeyes2-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/06/multimedia/05xp-popeyes2/05xp-popeyes2-jumbo.png', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/06/multimedia/05xp-popeyes2/05xp-popeyes2-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1276, 'width': 1912, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/06/multimedia/05xp-popeyes2/05xp-popeyes2-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/06/multimedia/05xp-popeyes2/05xp-popeyes2-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'th