 grid uses all 26 letters of the English alphabet at least once, but that’s just me. You might think they’re groovy.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/06/crosswords/06wordplay-spelunking/merlin_12466171_2dcdb184-8364-4210-ae4e-f74c4778c57e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/06/crosswords/06wordplay-spelunking/merlin_12466171_2dcdb184-8364-4210-ae4e-f74c4778c57e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/06/crosswords/06wordplay-spelunking/merlin_12466171_2dcdb184-8364-4210-ae4e-f74c4778c57e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/06/crosswords/06wordplay-spelunking/merlin_12466171_2dcdb184-8364-4210-ae4e-f74c4778c57e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1360, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/06/crosswords/06wordplay-spelunking/merlin_12466171_2dcdb184-8364-4210-ae4e-f74c4778c57e-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/06/crosswords/06wordplay-spelunking/merlin_12466171_2dcdb184-8364-4210-ae4e-f74c4778c57e-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/06/crosswords/06wordplay-spelunking/merlin_12466171_2dcdb184-8364-4210-ae4e-f74c4778c57e-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subTy