id': 'nyt://article/f17acee4-b15d-55fd-9c31-7cfc6acd0130', 'word_count': 933, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f17acee4-b15d-55fd-9c31-7cfc6acd0130'}, {'abstract': 'I spent five days last year fighting the California wildfires in Malibu. It felt like the combat patrols I had been on as a Marine in Afghanistan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/06/magazine/woolsey-fire-malibu-point-dume-bombers.html', 'snippet': 'I spent five days last year fighting the California wildfires in Malibu. It felt like the combat patrols I had been on as a Marine in Afghanistan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In boot camp, I was surprised by the pride the other recruits took in their no-name Midwest hometowns. By contrast, I had no love for Malibu, Calif., which seemed like only one thing to me: an isolated beach town too far from the city for me to escape. I did not surf. I had no luck with girls. Years before I was old enough to enlist, the Sept. 11 attacks gave me a sure direction away from a dysfunctional home: I was determined to join the Marine Corps. So I spent my youth running Malibu’s hills, swimming its coast, avoiding a home that smelled of stale white wine and counting the days until I could enlist in the military. But my antipathy toward Malibu did nothing to stem a stream of brotherly abuse from the other recruits for what they perceived as my star-studded hometown. Their idea of Malibu was very different from what my reality had been.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/06/magazine/06atwar-woolseyfire-01/06atwar-woolseyfire-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 411, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/06/magazine/06atwar-woolseyfire-01/06atwar-woolseyfire-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 411}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/06/magazine/06atwar-woolseyfire-01/06atwar-woolseyfire-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 702, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/06/magazine/06atwar-woolseyfire-01/06atwar-woolseyfire-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1403, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/06/magazine/06atwar-woolseyfire-01/06atwar-woolseyfire-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/06/magazine/06atwar-woolseyfire-01/06atwar-woolseyfire-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/06/magazine/06atwar-woolseyfire-01/06atwar-woolseyfire-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'My Neighborhood Was on Fire. My Neighbors Came Together to Save It.', 'kicker': 'at war', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fires and Firefighters', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Evacuations and Evacuees', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Marine Corps', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Malibu (Calif)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-11-06T10:00:11+0000', 'document_ty