yt://article/770f8c46-f0ce-5690-8987-686ae4b015b1', 'word_count': 777, 'uri': 'nyt://article/770f8c46-f0ce-5690-8987-686ae4b015b1'}, {'abstract': 'Why more sleep isn’t always the answer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/06/parenting/the-exhaustion-is-real.html', 'snippet': 'Why more sleep isn’t always the answer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'While on a business trip in Chicago last month, I accidentally slept for 12 hours. I fell asleep at 9:30 p.m. local time and didn’t set an alarm, because I figured there was no way I would sleep past 7:30 a.m. Cue me waking with a jolt at 9:30 a.m., and only because housekeeping knocked on the door. I probably could have gone a solid 14 if left uninterrupted.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/05/multimedia/6-parenting-nl-timepressure/6-parenting-nl-timepressure-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/05/multimedia/6-parenting-nl-timepressure/6-parenting-nl-timepressure-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/05/multimedia/6-parenting-nl-timepressure/6-parenting-nl-timepressure-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/05/multimedia/6-parenting-nl-timepressure/6-parenting-nl-timepressure-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1166, 'width': 1750, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/05/multimedia/6-parenting-nl-timepressure/6-parenting-nl-timepressure-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75,