/11/06/us/puerto-rico-corruption-arrest.html', 'snippet': 'Federal prosecutors said that when he was a mayor, Senator Abel Nazario and two aides illegally used tax money to pay five campaign workers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MIAMI — The federal authorities in Puerto Rico arrested Senator Abel Nazario Quiñones and seven other people on Wednesday, accusing them of theft or bribery during Mr. Nazario’s time as mayor of the town of Yauco. It was Mr. Nazario’s second corruption-related arrest in 14 months.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/06/us/06Puerto-Rico/06Puerto-Rico-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 429, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/06/us/06Puerto-Rico/06Puerto-Rico-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 429}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/06/us/06Puerto-Rico/06Puerto-Rico-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 732, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/06/us/06Puerto-Rico/06Puerto-Rico-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1430, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/06/us/06Puerto-Rico/06Puerto-Rico-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/06/us/06Puerto-Rico/06Puerto-Rico-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/06/us/06Puerto-Rico/06Puerto-Rico-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subT