}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/68bf8ad7-d441-51d6-a79e-fc5549927921', 'word_count': 1776, 'uri': 'nyt://article/68bf8ad7-d441-51d6-a79e-fc5549927921'}, {'abstract': 'Lauren Greenfield turns a cool, clinical eye on the seemingly unsinkable, unstoppable former first lady of the Philippines.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/06/movies/the-kingmaker-review.html', 'snippet': 'Lauren Greenfield turns a cool, clinical eye on the seemingly unsinkable, unstoppable former first lady of the Philippines.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was always a little too easy to laugh at Imelda Marcos. The gold and the kitsch, the fine art and the tchotchkes, the rows of bedazzled shoes and the towering dome of shellacked hair — it was all so very much, so very vulgar, so very, very expensive. During the roughly two decades that Marcos was the first lady of the Philippines, she became famous for lavish habits that make the Kardashians seem like skinflints. Even after the Marcos family fled the Philippines in 1986, her extravagance often received more attention than her role in what was called a “conjugal dictatorship.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/08/arts/00kingmaker/merlin_163599066_ae8d5a79-016f-424f-bb19-960543c231b5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/08/arts/00kingmaker/merlin_163599066_ae8d5a79-016f-424f-bb19-960543c231b5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/08/arts/00kingmaker/merlin_163599066_ae8d5a79-016f-424f-bb19-960543c231b5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/08/arts/00kingmaker/merlin_163599066_ae8d5a79-016f-424f-bb19-960543c231b5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/08/arts/00kingmaker/00kingmaker-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/08/arts/00kingmaker/00kingmaker-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/08/arts/00kingmaker/00kingmaker-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘The Kingmaker’ Review: The Power and Vainglory of Imelda Marcos', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Some Time in Imelda Marcos’s Shoes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Marcos, Imelda R', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Philippines', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Kingmaker (Movie)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Greenfield, Lauren', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-11-06T19:41:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Manohla Dargis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Manohla', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Dargis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/35895a0f-fcba-584b-93d2-88d4fc182f1c', 'word_count': 853, 'uri': 'nyt://article/35895a0f-fcba-584b-93d2-88d4fc182f1c'}, {'abstract': 'A shack in the forest. A good, long hike. A solstice celebration. Carson Ellis, Eliza Wheeler, Gary D. Schmidt and more remind us how to be at home in the wilderness.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/06/books/review/the-shortest-day-carson-ellis-susan-cooper-nature-picture-books.html', 'snippet': 'A shack in the forest. A good, long hike. A solstice celebration. Carson Ellis, Eliza Wheeler, Gary D. Schmidt and more remind us how to be at home in the wilderness.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This past summer bees were voted the most important living beings on earth. While I agree wholeheartedly, I also enjoy imagining this vote, conducted by scientists at the Royal Geographic Society of London, democratically including all living species. Imagine the mushrooms at the polls. Imagine the snakes and the sequoias casting their ballots.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/10/books/review/10Hunt-1/10Hunt-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 270, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/10/books/review/10Hunt-1/10Hunt-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 270}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/10/books/review/10Hunt-1/10Hunt-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 461, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/10/books/review/10Hunt-1/10Hunt-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 922, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/10/books/revie