ences to his presidency than any modern occupant of the Oval Office has confronted at one time.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Another day, another legal battle. Or two. Or three. In one court, a longtime political ally just went on trial. In another, judges ordered his accounting firm to turn over his tax returns. In still another, a writer who claims he raped her filed a defamation lawsuit against him. In a fourth, a judge overturned an anti-abortion policy.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/05/us/politics/05dc-assess1/merlin_163898466_6d4b6f92-87af-44a1-9bc5-598eba0f27c7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 390, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/05/us/politics/05dc-assess1/merlin_163898466_6d4b6f92-87af-44a1-9bc5-598eba0f27c7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 390}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/05/us/politics/05dc-assess1/merlin_163898466_6d4b6f92-87af-44a1-9bc5-598eba0f27c7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 666, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/05/us/politics/05dc-assess1/merlin_163898466_6d4b6f92-87af-44a1-9bc5-598eba0f27c7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1331, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/05/us/politics/05dc-assess1/05dc-assess1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/05/us/politics/05dc-assess1/05dc-assess1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbn