t eliminate as part of an initial trade agreement.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Trump on Friday said he had not yet agreed to roll back any of the tariffs he had imposed on China and that, if a deal is reached, he would not eliminate all of the levies he’s placed on $360 billion worth of goods.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/08/business/08dc-uschina/merlin_155141262_14e74fcd-25bc-45ae-acf9-1e458b8ff5d3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/08/business/08dc-uschina/merlin_155141262_14e74fcd-25bc-45ae-acf9-1e458b8ff5d3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/08/business/08dc-uschina/merlin_155141262_14e74fcd-25bc-45ae-acf9-1e458b8ff5d3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/08/business/08dc-uschina/merlin_155141262_14e74fcd-25bc-45ae-acf9-1e458b8ff5d3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/08/business/08dc-uschina/merlin_155141262_14e74fcd-25bc-45ae-acf9-1e458b8ff5d3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/08/business/08dc-uschina/merlin_155141262_14e74fcd-25bc-45ae-acf9-1e458b8ff5d3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type'