zzle may put you down for the count.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/09/crosswords/daily-puzzle-2019-11-10.html', 'snippet': 'Peter Gordon’s puzzle may put you down for the count.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SUNDAY PUZZLE — I am glad you all have the same grid in your hands, because I do not think I would be able to convince solvers of its existence otherwise — the letter pattern that we have to suss out is so unusual. Peter Gordon has been contributing to The Times for four decades now, preceding Will Shortz. According to Mr. Shortz’s introduction in the print version, the first Sunday grid he edited was a creation of Mr. Gordon’s. (It was a puzzle of many colors, and was very cool.)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/10/crosswords/10wordplay-heiden/10wordplay-heiden-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 387, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/10/crosswords/10wordplay-heiden/10wordplay-heiden-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 387}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/10/crosswords/10wordplay-heiden/10wordplay-heiden-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 660, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/10/crosswords/10wordplay-heiden/10wordplay-heiden-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1321, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/10/crosswords/10wordplay-heiden/10wordplay-heiden-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/10/crosswords/10wo