ama-tigers-tide.html', 'snippet': 'The No. 2 Tigers took a 20-point lead into halftime, but the No. 3 Crimson Tide charged back in the fourth quarter, ultimately coming up short.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TUSCALOOSA, Ala. — Here it was, with Bryant-Denny Stadium in full-throated roar and Alabama charging hard — just as the Crimson Tide always do, having risen once again from the coroner’s slab — so Louisiana State did what it has done in every moment that has mattered this season.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/09/sports/09lsu-alabama-lede/merlin_164124201_93fb3b4a-9baa-49cc-9d60-56d16102331d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/09/sports/09lsu-alabama-lede/merlin_164124201_93fb3b4a-9baa-49cc-9d60-56d16102331d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/09/sports/09lsu-alabama-lede/merlin_164124201_93fb3b4a-9baa-49cc-9d60-56d16102331d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/09/sports/09lsu-alabama-lede/merlin_164124201_93fb3b4a-9baa-49cc-9d60-56d16102331d-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/09/sports/09lsu-alabama-lede/merlin_164124201_93fb3b4a-9baa-49cc-9d60-56d16102331d-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/09/sports/09lsu-alabama-lede/me