lo dance, remade the group choreography for later revivals. The article also mischaracterizes the arrangement by which “Einstein” came to the Metropolitan Opera in 1976. It was a co-presentation with the Met, not a rental of its theater. The article also carries an incorrect dateline. It was reported from Stanford University, which is in Stanford, Calif., not Palo Alto.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: November 10, 2019', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2019-11-10T01:39:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Corrections', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/81ed5996-c628-5f9a-bd0e-e926549869b8', 'word_count': 468, 'uri': 'nyt://article/81ed5996-c628-5f9a-bd0e-e926549869b8'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the Day for Sunday, November 10, 2019.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/09/todayspaper/quotation-of-the-day-once-red-redoubts-suburbs-turn-virginia-blue.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the Day for Sunday, November 10, 2019.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Guns, that is the most pressing issue for me. There are lots of other issues, but you can only fix them if you are alive.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day: Once Red Redoubts, Suburbs Turn Virginia Blue', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quote of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2019-11-10T01:43:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Today’s Paper', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/c3235f02-890c-58e8-