. It’s Veterans Day, and let’s take a moment to acknowledge and thank all those who have served in the armed forces of the United States. Let’s thank them for their work in the wars we have fought in the past and the ones we have been fighting for the last 18 years. It has been difficult, life-altering combat. It is important to recognize that. It matters.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/24/dining/ml-hulihuli-chicken/ml-hulihuli-chicken-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/24/dining/ml-hulihuli-chicken/ml-hulihuli-chicken-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 480}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/24/dining/ml-hulihuli-chicken/ml-hulihuli-chicken-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/24/dining/ml-hulihuli-chicken/ml-hulihuli-chicken-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1638, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/24/dining/ml-hulihuli-chicken/ml-hulihuli-chicken-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/24/dining/ml-hulihuli-chicken/ml-hulihuli-chicken-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/24/dining/ml-hulihuli-chicken/ml-hulihuli-chicken-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thum