e chief of staff, said he would obey President Trump’s order not to testify rather than seek a judge’s ruling first.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/12/us/politics/mulvaney-impeachment-subpoena.html', 'snippet': 'Mick Mulvaney, the acting White House chief of staff, said he would obey President Trump’s order not to testify rather than seek a judge’s ruling first.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Mick Mulvaney, the acting White House chief of staff, reversed gears on Tuesday and said he would follow President Trump’s order to defy a House subpoena and refuse to testify as part of its impeachment inquiry rather than seek a judge’s ruling.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/12/us/politics/12dc-mulvaney/merlin_162872460_aca42b48-b334-462a-a998-ea57491b4a07-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 374, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/12/us/politics/12dc-mulvaney/merlin_162872460_aca42b48-b334-462a-a998-ea57491b4a07-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 374}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/12/us/politics/12dc-mulvaney/merlin_162872460_aca42b48-b334-462a-a998-ea57491b4a07-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 638, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/12/us/politics/12dc-mulvaney/merlin_162872460_aca42b48-b334-462a-a998-ea57491b4a07-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1277, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/12/us/politics/12dc-mulvaney/merlin_162872460_aca42b48-b334-462a-a998-ea5749