551-a6bc-ac13eee78fd7'}, {'abstract': 'The president’s eldest son is using a newfound platform as an author to recast the story of the 2016 election — and every political battle that came after.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/13/us/politics/donald-trump-jr-triggered.html', 'snippet': 'The president’s eldest son is using a newfound platform as an author to recast the story of the 2016 election — and every political battle that came after.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — On the eve of the first public hearing in the Democratic-led impeachment against President Trump, his eldest son was standing in the lobby of the family hotel, delivering firm handshakes and turning over copies of his book, “Triggered: How the Left Thrives on Hate and Wants to Silence Us,” to supporters who had paid $32 for the experience.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/13/nyregion/13dc-junior1/merlin_163916151_3889c6d2-0359-4155-a718-d20fed7dd5d6-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 410, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/13/nyregion/13dc-junior1/merlin_163916151_3889c6d2-0359-4155-a718-d20fed7dd5d6-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 410}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/13/nyregion/13dc-junior1/merlin_163916151_3889c6d2-0359-4155-a718-d20fed7dd5d6-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 699, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/13/nyregion/13dc-junior1/merlin_163916151_3889c6d2-0359-4155-a718-d20fed7dd5d6-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1399, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thum