b50a-3fa208451829'}, {'abstract': 'This meandering jazz-infused drama, told across generations of a black family, strains to pull its focus from white women.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/13/theater/broadbend-arkansas-review.html', 'snippet': 'This meandering jazz-infused drama, told across generations of a black family, strains to pull its focus from white women.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Halfway through “Broadbend, Arkansas,” an ill-conceived new musical at the Duke on 42nd Street, an exhale moment arrives. At the top of Act 2, this jazz-infused show springs forward from the early 1960s to the late 1980s and switches storytellers — a new character, played by a new actor, speaking and singing the words of a new librettist.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/16/arts/13broadbend/merlin_164268333_73d8ff9a-2fe9-450c-b190-9609cc52f255-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/16/arts/13broadbend/merlin_164268333_73d8ff9a-2fe9-450c-b190-9609cc52f255-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/16/arts/13broadbend/merlin_164268333_73d8ff9a-2fe9-450c-b190-9609cc52f255-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/16/arts/13broadbend/merlin_164268333_73d8ff9a-2fe9-450c-b190-9609cc52f255-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/16/arts/13broadbend/merlin_1