y period when she was left with 54 cents in take-home pay. It was 61 hours, not 80.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: November 14, 2019', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2019-11-14T01:56:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Corrections', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Correction', '_id': 'nyt://article/fd924ecf-de96-5d27-8556-7dc6c1f0d906', 'word_count': 318, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fd924ecf-de96-5d27-8556-7dc6c1f0d906'}, {'abstract': 'Kaepernick, who has been out of the league since the 2016 season, has requested a list of who will be coming to see him on Saturday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/13/sports/football/colin-kaepernick-workout.html', 'snippet': 'Kaepernick, who has been out of the league since the 2016 season, has requested a list of who will be coming to see him on Saturday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Colin Kaepernick’s long road back to the N.F.L. has hit another snag.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/13/sports/13kaepernick1/merlin_159069303_a42c9301-ff2f-4ba8-8e34-7044c0912e29-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 427, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/13/sports/13kaepernick1/merlin_159069303_a42c9301-ff2f-4ba8-8e34-7044c0912e29-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 427}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/13/sports/13kaepernick1/merlin_159069303_a42c9301-ff2f-4ba8-8e34-7044c0912e29-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 729, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumb