 are two easy tricks you can master today.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/13/smarter-living/how-to-do-2-simple-magic-tricks-and-why-you-should-learn-them.html', 'snippet': 'You don’t have to be a wizard to do magic tricks. The secrets are simple, and anyone can learn them. Here are two easy tricks you can master today.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I could see the gold lion even before my cab came to a stop: the flowing mane, the three-foot-long fangs — leg muscles knotted, ready to pounce. It was as if he was taunting me to enter the 30-story building that he was so aggressively guarding: a massive casino.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/16/smarter-living/magic_opener/magic_opener-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/16/smarter-living/magic_opener/magic_opener-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/16/smarter-living/magic_opener/magic_opener-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/16/smarter-living/magic_opener/magic_opener-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 870, 'width': 1305, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/16/smarter-living/magic_opener/magic_opener-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/16/smarter-living/magic_opener/magic_opener-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subty