1463073-1a2f-5a23-8eef-388533e43b1a'}, {'abstract': 'Jenifer McShane’s documentary introduces an empathetic method for policing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/14/movies/ernie-and-joe-crisis-cops-review.html', 'snippet': 'Jenifer McShane’s documentary introduces an empathetic method for policing.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Ernie & Joe: Crisis Cops,” Jenifer McShane’s nonfiction portrait of two officers working in the San Antonio police department’s mental health unit, arrives at a time of continued debate about what constitutes excessive policing. For Ernie Stevens and Joe Smarro, the goal is to defuse potentially violent encounters with the mentally ill and steer them into treatment instead of jail. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/15/arts/15ERNIEANDJOE/merlin_164172612_ed123d02-c467-4f8d-a182-fcbb896c49af-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 337, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/15/arts/15ERNIEANDJOE/merlin_164172612_ed123d02-c467-4f8d-a182-fcbb896c49af-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 337}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/15/arts/15ERNIEANDJOE/merlin_164172612_ed123d02-c467-4f8d-a182-fcbb896c49af-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 575, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/15/arts/15ERNIEANDJOE/merlin_164172612_ed123d02-c467-4f8d-a182-fcbb896c49af-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 808, 'width': 1440, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/15/arts/15ERNIEANDJOE/merlin_164172612_ed123