ces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Gaza Strip', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civilian Casualties', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Abu al-Ata, Baha', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Palestinian Islamic Jihad', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Netanyahu, Benjamin', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-11-15T13:04:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Iyad Abuheweila and David M. Halbfinger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Iyad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Abuheweila', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/301425cc-e090-5f4d-952e-61412221eba3', 'word_count': 957, 'uri': 'nyt://article/301425cc-e090-5f4d-952e-61412221eba3'}, {'abstract': 'City, the Premier League champion, had tried to block an investigation into its finances by appealing to sports’ highest court even before a punishment was handed down.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/15/sports/manchester-city-champions-league-ban.html', 'snippet': 'City, the Premier League champion, had tried to block an investigation into its finances by appealing to sports’ highest court even before a punishment was handed down.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MONTREUX, Switzerland — An attempt by Manchester City to block an investigation into its finances and spending was rejected Friday by the Court of Arbitration for Sport, which ruled that the club’s appeal was “inadmissible” because European soccer officials have not yet issued a ruling in the case.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/15/sports/15mancity/merlin_164159691_42078179-5197-4576-842e-0879c826f837-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 402, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/15/sports/15mancity/merlin_164159691_42078179-5197-4576-842e-0879c826f837-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 402}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/15/sports/15mancity/merlin_164159691_42078179-5197-4576-842e-0879c826f837-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 686, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/15/sports/15mancity/merlin_164159691_42078179-5197-4576-842e-0879c826f837-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1373, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/15/sports/15mancity/merlin_164159691_42078179-5197-4576-842e-0879c826f837-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/15/sports/15mancity/merlin_164159691_42078179-5197-4576-842e-0879c826f837-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/15/sports/15mancity/merlin_164159691_42078179-5197-4576-842e-0879c826f837-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Manchester C