://article/6b1f8451-e5c9-51be-a837-03c676e728d9'}, {'abstract': 'The White House’s release of a memo about the call does not mention “corruption,” which appeared in an earlier description of the conversation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/15/us/politics/trump-phone-call-transcript.html', 'snippet': 'The White House’s release of a memo about the call does not mention “corruption,” which appeared in an earlier description of the conversation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Trump on Friday released a memorandum of an April telephone conversation he had with President Volodymyr Zelensky of Ukraine that differed from a summary of the call released by the White House months ago. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/14/nyregion/14dc-transcript/merlin_164022885_034622bf-0e88-4632-a2c6-d4c5b17035f7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 420, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/14/nyregion/14dc-transcript/merlin_164022885_034622bf-0e88-4632-a2c6-d4c5b17035f7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 420}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/14/nyregion/14dc-transcript/merlin_164022885_034622bf-0e88-4632-a2c6-d4c5b17035f7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 717, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/14/nyregion/14dc-transcript/merlin_164022885_034622bf-0e88-4632-a2c6-d4c5b17035f7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1435, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/14/nyregion/14dc-transcript/