d” that he vilified her in a call with another foreign leader, as Mr. Trump attacked her in real time on Twitter, drawing a stern warning about witness intimidation from Democrats.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ex-Envoy to Ukraine ‘Devastated’ as Trump Vilified Her', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ex-Envoy to Ukraine ‘Devastated’ as Trump Vilified Her', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Yovanovitch, Marie L', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Trump-Ukraine Whistle-blower Complaint and Impeachment Inquiry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corruption (Institutional)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diplomatic Service, Embassies and Consulates', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House Committee on Intelligence', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ukraine', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-11-15T19:48:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sheryl Gay Stolberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sheryl', 'middlename': 'Gay', 'lastname': 'Stolberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bcf0e691-46a5-5138-bb33-1df5185f4a3c', 'word_count': 1779, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bcf0e691-46a5-5138-bb33-1df5185f4a3c'}, {'abstract': 'Every year, New York lawmakers and interest groups decamp to Puerto Rico for a cozy weekend. I decided to check it out.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/15/reader-cen