ar-erin-morgenstern.html', 'snippet': 'It took eight years, but the author of “The Night Circus” is back, and she has another bestseller.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GAME ON Erin Morgenstern made two important moves in preparing to work on her second novel, “The Starless Sea,” which lands at No. 3 on this week’s hardcover fiction list. First, she relocated from Manhattan to western Massachusetts, moving into a house that wasn’t wired for cable or the internet. Morgenstern says, “It was a strange time not to have internet — from the summer of 2016 to mid-2018 — but it took the outside noise away, and also some of the pressure of the sophomore novel after the big debut.”', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '32', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/24/books/review/24insidethelist-web/24insidethelist-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 825, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/24/books/review/24insidethelist-web/24insidethelist-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 825}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/24/books/review/24insidethelist-web/24insidethelist-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 745, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/24/books/review/24insidethelist-web/24insidethelist-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1375, 'width': 1000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/24/books/review/24insidethelist-web/24insidethelist-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thu