milar doubt about the guilt of the accused.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/19/us/death-penalty-rodney-reed-crimes.html', 'snippet': 'A Texas court suspended Rodney Reed’s execution. But researchers say other current cases raise similar doubt about the guilt of the accused.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The number of executions in the United States remains close to nearly a three-decade low. And yet the decline has not prevented what those who closely track the death penalty see as a disturbing trend: a significant number of cases in which prisoners are being put to death, or whose execution dates are near, despite questions about their guilt. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/19/us/19DEATHROW-rodrick/19DEATHROW-rodrick-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/19/us/19DEATHROW-rodrick/19DEATHROW-rodrick-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/19/us/19DEATHROW-rodrick/19DEATHROW-rodrick-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/19/us/19DEATHROW-rodrick/19DEATHROW-rodrick-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/19/us/19DEATHROW-rodrick/19DEATHROW-rodrick-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/19/us/19DEATHROW-rodrick/19DEATHROW-rodrick-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/19/us/19DEATHROW-rodrick/19DEATHROW-rodrick-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Not Just Rodney Reed: New Evidence Taints More Death Row Convictions', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Raising Doubts About the Guilt of Some on Death Row', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Capital Punishment', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders, Attempted Murders and Homicides', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'False Arrests, Convictions and Imprisonments', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Death Penalty Information Center', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Innocence Project', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ALLEY, SEDLEY', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Glossip, Richard Eugene (1963- )', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reed, Rodney (1967- )', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Oklahoma', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Texas', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Swearingen, Larry', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dailey, James Milton', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-11-19T19:12:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard A. Oppel Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': 'A.', 'lastname': 'Oppel', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e0a21290-fbbc-5cee-9664-f987278ccc4c', 'word_count': 1604, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e0a21290-fbbc-5cee-9664-f987278ccc4c'}, {'abstract': 'New scans showed how the brains of people who had a hemisphere removed in childhood continue to function.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/19/health/brain-removal-hemispherectomies-scans.html', 'snippet': 'New scans showed how the brains of people who had a hemisphere removed in childhood continue to function.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Shortly after the birth of her first son, Monika Jones learned that he had a rare neurological condition that made one side of his brain abnormally large. Her son, Henry, endured hundreds of seizures a day. Despite receiving high doses of medication, his little body seemed like a rag doll as one episode blended into another. He required several surgeries, starting when he was 3 1/2 months old, eventually leading to a complete anatomical hemispherectomy, or the removal of half of his brain, when he turned 3.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/19/science/19TB-BRAINSCANS/19TB-BRAINSCANS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/19/science/19TB-BRAINSCANS/19TB-BRAINSCANS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/19/science/19TB-BRAINSCANS/19TB-BRAINSCANS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/19/science/19TB-BRAINSCANS/19TB-BRAINSCANS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'capti