me': 'Marshall', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7b7a3263-ddf2-5abf-99be-79c8b6158d96', 'word_count': 1024, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7b7a3263-ddf2-5abf-99be-79c8b6158d96'}, {'abstract': 'Modern Love in miniature, featuring reader-submitted stories of no more than 100 words.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/19/style/tiny-modern-love-stories-romantic-tragedy-to-comedy.html', 'snippet': 'Modern Love in miniature, featuring reader-submitted stories of no more than 100 words.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The sign read: Cross Ford at Your Own Risk. “What’s a ford?” I asked. “A low water bridge,” you said, slowing the car. The ford was submerged, but you drove onto it and opened your door. Water rushed beneath the car. “Open yours,” you said. I sat, frozen. You laughed. I opened the door an inch, then more. “Now listen.” The sound of the creek filled the car. I breathed in wet grass, mud, dead leaves. I reached down and let the water run through my fingertips. Life with you, I knew, would be different. — Jessica Braun', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/12/fashion/12ML-TINYLOVE-ILLO1/12ML-TINYLOVE-ILLO1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/12/fashion/12ML-TINYLOVE-ILLO1/12ML-TINYLOVE-ILLO1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/12/fashion/12ML-TINYLOVE-ILLO1/12ML-TINYLOVE-ILLO1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/12/fashion/12ML-TINYLOVE-ILLO1/12ML-TINYLOVE-ILLO1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/12/fashion/12ML-TINYLOVE-ILLO1/12ML-TINYLOVE-ILLO1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/12/fashion/12ML-TINYLOVE-ILLO1/12ML-TINYLOVE-ILLO1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/12/fashion/12ML-TINYLOVE-ILLO1/12ML-TINYLOVE-ILLO1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Tiny Love Stories: ‘From Romantic Tragedy to Romantic Comedy’', 'kicker': 'Modern Love', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Love (Emotion)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Modern Love (Times Column)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dating and Relationships', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Popcorn', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-11-19T19:30:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e038de94-591b-5648-a42c-3f1d5304c571', 'word_count': 482, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e038de94-591b-5648-a42c-3f1d5304c571'}, {'abstract': 'Here’s what you need to know.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/19/briefing/us-china-trade-impeachment-bei-bei-panda.html', 'snippet': 'Here’s what you need to know.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the first of three packed days of testimony in the impeachment inquiry this wee