 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/20/books/book-deals-politicians-baltimore-catherine-pugh.html', 'snippet': 'The former Baltimore mayor Catherine Pugh, charged with fraud over her “Healthy Holly” children’s series, isn’t the first elected official who’s run into book trouble.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Under normal circumstances, any author who raked in $600,000 for a series of self-published children’s books would be snapped up by a prestigious publisher and handed a lucrative multi-book deal. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/20/books/20POLBOOK/merlin_152973195_3cee9284-11bc-4b73-b286-15eebb71f32b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 376, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/20/books/20POLBOOK/merlin_152973195_3cee9284-11bc-4b73-b286-15eebb71f32b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 376}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/20/books/20POLBOOK/merlin_152973195_3cee9284-11bc-4b73-b286-15eebb71f32b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 641, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/20/books/20POLBOOK/merlin_152973195_3cee9284-11bc-4b73-b286-15eebb71f32b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1283, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/20/books/20POLBOOK/merlin_152973195_3cee9284-11bc-4b73-b286-15eebb71f32b-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/20/books/20POLBOOK/merlin_152973195_3cee9284-11bc-4b73-b286-15eebb71f32b-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth