ane alternative, but it was also clearly intended to deter new arrivals.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/20/world/europe/greece-migrants-aegean-islands.html', 'snippet': 'The government’s plan to redistribute asylum seekers was presented as a more humane alternative, but it was also clearly intended to deter new arrivals.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ATHENS — The Greek government said on Wednesday that it would replace intensely overcrowded migrant camps on the Aegean Islands with new centers that would be more restrictive of the migrants’ movements.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/21/world/21greece-print/merlin_161844780_49914b3a-4b4f-4852-b37a-a0f8e39ba8da-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/21/world/21greece-print/merlin_161844780_49914b3a-4b4f-4852-b37a-a0f8e39ba8da-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/21/world/21greece-print/merlin_161844780_49914b3a-4b4f-4852-b37a-a0f8e39ba8da-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/21/world/21greece-print/merlin_161844780_49914b3a-4b4f-4852-b37a-a0f8e39ba8da-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/21/world/21greece-print/20greece-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/21/world/21greece-pr