0f-a4fa-c67d14af267c'}, {'abstract': 'Don’t ignore a feeling that you have more than you need. Talk about money — with family and others.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/21/magazine/resource-generation.html', 'snippet': 'Don’t ignore a feeling that you have more than you need. Talk about money — with family and others.', 'lead_paragraph': '“First you need to figure out: What do I actually have? How much can I access?” says Willa Conway, who is 31, currently has $3 million at her disposal and will eventually inherit millions more from a sand-mining fortune. Don’t ignore a feeling that you have more than you need. When Conway was in her mid-20s, a graduate-school adviser told her about Resource Generation, which helps the young and wealthy redistribute their wealth. At a four-day retreat Conway attended, a presenter said, “Give your money to social-justice organizing led by people most impacted by oppression.” After Michael Brown Jr. was shot by the police in Ferguson, Mo., Conway helped lead a campaign that raised $1.4 million for more than 100 organizing groups led by African-Americans.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/24/magazine/24Mag-Tip-1/24Mag-Tip-1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 311, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/24/magazine/24Mag-Tip-1/24Mag-Tip-1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 311}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/24/magazine/24Mag-Tip-1/24Mag-Tip-1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 530, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/24/magazine/24Mag-Tip-1/24Mag-Tip-1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 