19/11/21/movies/varda-by-agnes-review.html', 'snippet': 'In her last film, Agnès Varda sums up a six-decade career.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Admirers of Agnès Varda, who died in March at 90, may be looking for a fitting remembrance. Especially in the last two decades of her long career, she was an unusually and deeply companionable filmmaker. Her death feels like the loss of a friend, even to people who never met her. At the same time, those who are unfamiliar with and curious about Varda’s work may be wondering where to begin. With characteristic generosity, her final film, “Varda by Agnès,” answers both needs. It’s a perfect introduction and a lovely valediction.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/22/arts/22AGNES-1/merlin_164638245_14ea6f29-2559-411e-97f3-d39cc31a7cbb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/22/arts/22AGNES-1/merlin_164638245_14ea6f29-2559-411e-97f3-d39cc31a7cbb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/22/arts/22AGNES-1/merlin_164638245_14ea6f29-2559-411e-97f3-d39cc31a7cbb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/22/arts/22AGNES-1/merlin_164638245_14ea6f29-2559-411e-97f3-d39cc31a7cbb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/22/arts/22AGNES-1/22AGNES-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name':