stract': 'This unsettling expose about the founder of Bikram yoga is the opposite of a meditative reprieve.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/21/movies/bikram-yogi-guru-predator-review.html', 'snippet': 'This unsettling expose about the founder of Bikram yoga is the opposite of a meditative reprieve.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The new Netflix documentary “Bikram: Yogi, Guru, Predator” is the Oscar-winning filmmaker Eva Orner’s portrait of the rise and fall of the yoga magnate Bikram Choudhury. The film first traces how Choudhury built his “Bikram” empire of hot yoga studios, training celebrities and amassing devotees as America’s favorite yogi. The narrative then turns to the accusations of sexual abuse that unmasked the sordid man behind the wellness phenomenon.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/21/arts/21bikram/21bikram-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 346, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/21/arts/21bikram/21bikram-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 346}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/21/arts/21bikram/21bikram-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 591, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/21/arts/21bikram/21bikram-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1182, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/21/arts/21bikram/21bikram-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/21/arts/21bikram/21bikram-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwid