542653e8-2cc2-5200-bdcc-ecc5356c63eb'}, {'abstract': 'In the South, black houses of worship are reducing the social suffering of H.I.V. with an approach that recalls Dr. King’s teachings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/21/opinion/how-churches-fight-the-stigma-of-hiv.html', 'snippet': 'In the South, black houses of worship are reducing the social suffering of H.I.V. with an approach that recalls Dr. King’s teachings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ATLANTA — The second Wednesday of the month is always crowded in the parking lot of Bible Way Ministries. That’s the day the church offers its community food bank — and as of this year, it’s also the day when an AIDS Healthcare Foundation mobile testing unit rolls up to provide H.I.V. testing to anyone who wants it. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/21/opinion/21Fixes5/merlin_164803005_764b9e4a-ea8a-4e01-aa84-91ba89d5d570-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/21/opinion/21Fixes5/merlin_164803005_764b9e4a-ea8a-4e01-aa84-91ba89d5d570-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/21/opinion/21Fixes5/merlin_164803005_764b9e4a-ea8a-4e01-aa84-91ba89d5d570-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/21/opinion/21Fixes5/merlin_164803005_764b9e4a-ea8a-4e01-aa84-91ba89d5d570-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/21/opinion/21Fixes5/21Fixes5-thumbStand