amily: football on the television, apple pie on the table. That consistency offered me bittersweet consolation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/22/well/family/Thanksgiving-divorce-gratitude-family-kids.html', 'snippet': 'I imagined my children celebrating with their father’s family: football on the television, apple pie on the table. That consistency offered me bittersweet consolation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At Thanksgiving, when the seedling phase of my divorce from the father of my three children was well underway, we agreed it was time for us to start spending holidays apart.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/20/science/00TIESTHANKSGIVING/00TIESTHANKSGIVING-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/20/science/00TIESTHANKSGIVING/00TIESTHANKSGIVING-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/20/science/00TIESTHANKSGIVING/00TIESTHANKSGIVING-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/20/science/00TIESTHANKSGIVING/00TIESTHANKSGIVING-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/20/science/00TIESTHANKSGIVING/00TIESTHANKSGIVING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/20/science/00TIESTHANKSGIVING/00TIESTHANKSGIVING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0