 Dalí even though he began work on his wild masterpiece “The Garden of Earthly Delights” way back in 1490. (“I’ve always intended to try and write an album based on that painting,” Beck, 49, said. “I’m not sure how that would work.”)', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/24/arts/24MyTen-Beck/24MyTen-Beck-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/24/arts/24MyTen-Beck/24MyTen-Beck-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/24/arts/24MyTen-Beck/24MyTen-Beck-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/24/arts/24MyTen-Beck/24MyTen-Beck-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1350, 'width': 1350, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/24/arts/24MyTen-Beck/24MyTen-Beck-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/24/arts/24MyTen-Beck/24MyTen-Beck-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/24/arts/24MyTen-Beck/24MyTen-Beck-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Beck Is Captivated by American Myths and a $60 Guitar', 'kicker': 'My Ten', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What Beck Likes: Classic Art and a Cheap Guitar', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pop and Rock Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Beck', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-11-22T10:00:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Arts&Leisure', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lindsay Zoladz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lindsay', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zoladz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5b91aabd-4a67-5715-9ba2-0ad2929a84a6', 'word_count': 1181, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5b91aabd-4a67-5715-9ba2-0ad2929a84a6'}, {'abstract': 'Chop wood, carry water and other lessons that apply far beyond the gym.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/22/well/move/the-zen-of-weight-lifting.html', 'snippet': 'Chop wood, carry water and other lessons that apply far beyond the gym.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One of my favorite movements at the gym is called a farmer’s carry. You hold a heavy weight — for me, around 95 pounds — in each hand and attempt to walk with a solid, upright posture for between 30 and 60 seconds. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/26/well/voices-weightlifting/voices-weightlifting-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 326, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/26/well/voices-weightlifting/voices-weightlifting-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 326}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/26/well/voices-weightlifting/voices-weightlifting-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 556, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'ju