entless Invention” at Film at Lincoln Center is filled with highlights from a relatively recent period in Korea’s 100-year-old cinema tradition.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/22/movies/korea-cinema-parasite.html', 'snippet': '“Relentless Invention” at Film at Lincoln Center is filled with highlights from a relatively recent period in Korea’s 100-year-old cinema tradition.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Parasite” has burrowed in deep. The South Korean class satire, directed by Bong Joon Ho, is poised to be this year’s highest-grossing subtitled release in the United States. In May, when it became the first Korean-language movie to win the top prize at Cannes, the director noted that the festival had chosen to honor the film in the centennial year of Korean cinema, and called the award a “very great gift.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/23/arts/22Korean-Cinema-4/merlin_164736396_b85a364e-f5ae-436b-aef2-eebcaaa880b3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 733, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/23/arts/22Korean-Cinema-4/merlin_164736396_b85a364e-f5ae-436b-aef2-eebcaaa880b3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 733}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/23/arts/22Korean-Cinema-4/merlin_164736396_b85a364e-f5ae-436b-aef2-eebcaaa880b3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 839, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/23/arts/22Korean-Cinema-4/merlin_164736396_b85a364e-f5ae-436b-aef2-eebcaaa880b3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1677, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail',