ocratic National Committee in 2016; his accusation that the Obama administration wiretapped him; and his characterization of the whistle-blower’s report as baseless. Here’s a check of some of his newer assertions. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/22/nyregion/22dc-factcheck/merlin_164860605_189aa935-26d3-49d5-a9b2-2f790e356e68-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/22/nyregion/22dc-factcheck/merlin_164860605_189aa935-26d3-49d5-a9b2-2f790e356e68-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/22/nyregion/22dc-factcheck/merlin_164860605_189aa935-26d3-49d5-a9b2-2f790e356e68-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/22/nyregion/22dc-factcheck/merlin_164860605_189aa935-26d3-49d5-a9b2-2f790e356e68-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/22/nyregion/22dc-factcheck/22dc-factcheck-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/22/nyregion/22dc-factcheck/22dc-factcheck-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/22/nyregion/22dc-factcheck/22dc-factcheck-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': '