75-906e-0b919111a1ed'}, {'abstract': 'In 2001, friends asked Robert Bank and Alan Cohen to write mini biographies of themselves to be shared with the other.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/23/fashion/weddings/each-put-pen-to-paper-and-their-story-began.html', 'snippet': 'In 2001, friends asked Robert Bank and Alan Cohen to write mini biographies of themselves to be shared with the other.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Robert Evan Bank and Alan Lawrence Cohen are to be married Nov. 24 at B’nai Jeshurun in New York. Rabbi Shuli Passow is to officiate.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/24/fashion/weddings/24BANK/24BANK--articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 437, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/24/fashion/weddings/24BANK/24BANK--articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 437}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/24/fashion/weddings/24BANK/24BANK--jumbo.jpg', 'height': 746, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/24/fashion/weddings/24BANK/24BANK--superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1492, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/24/fashion/weddings/24BANK/24BANK--thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/24/fashion/weddings/24BANK/24BANK--thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/24/fashion/weddings/24BANK/24BANK--thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Each Put Pen to Paper, and Their Story Began', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Putting Pen to Paper, Their Story Began', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-11-23T05:00:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Weddings', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vincent M. Mallozzi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vincent', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4ac9cba3-8fbf-559b-9767-ebc8c6ed1544', 'word_count': 731, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4ac9cba3-8fbf-559b-9767-ebc8c6ed1544'}, {'abstract': 'Corrections that appeared in print on Saturday, Nov. 23, 2019.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/23/pageoneplus/corrections-nov-23-2019.html', 'snippet': 'Corrections that appeared in print on Saturday, Nov. 23, 2019.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An article on Friday about a family in India who masqueraded for decades as Oudh royalty misstated the dollar value of 10,000 rupees in 1975. It was about $1,200, not $90,000.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: Nov. 23, 2019', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2019-11-23T05:07:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Corrections', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Correction', '_id': 'nyt://article/f9137a38-744c-51e2-b18d-ec6c6c0c5261', 'word_count': 266, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f9137a38-744c-51e2-b18d-ec6c6c0c5261'}, {'abstract': 'The “Saturday Night Live” veteran returns to host for a fifth time, and a dystopian sci-fi series begins streaming on Amazon.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/23/arts/television/whats-on-tv-saturday-will-ferrell-on-snl-and-the-feed.html', 'snippet': 'The “Saturday Night Live” veteran returns to host for a fifth time, and a dystopian sci-fi series begins streaming on Amazon.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SATURDAY NIGHT LIVE 11:29 p.m. on NBC. It’s hard to believe that Will Ferrell, who was an “S.N.L.” cast member for seven years and is credited with some of the show’s most memorable characters, will just now be hosting the show for a fifth time. On Saturday, Ferrell will be inaugurated into the so-called Five-Timers Club, joining a group of stars that includes Bill Murray, Justin Timberlake and Tina Fey. Before becoming a major movie star, Ferrell got big laughs as the cowbell-happy member of the Blue Öyster Cult and as Craig, the pep rally-ready Spartan cheerleader, as well as for his spot-on impressions of George W. Bush, Robert Goulet and Alex Trebek. The musical guest will be the 20-year-old songwriter King Princess, making her “S.N.L.” debut.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/23/arts/23tvcol-snl2/23tvcol-snl2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/23/arts/23tvcol-snl2/23tvcol-snl2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/23/arts/23tvcol-snl2/23tvcol-snl2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}},