sports/phoenix-suns-devin-booker.html', 'snippet': 'Devin Booker’s long-suffering time with the Suns is finally paying off, with the team’s ups and downs coalescing into success.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PHOENIX — The Suns are familiar with adversity. Long considered one of the league’s more dysfunctional franchises this side of Madison Square Garden, Phoenix has not tasted the postseason since 2010, back when many of the players on the current roster were in high school.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/23/sports/23nba-suns-lede/merlin_164829324_9a1b5546-56de-4a79-8cfb-33458d816d7c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/23/sports/23nba-suns-lede/merlin_164829324_9a1b5546-56de-4a79-8cfb-33458d816d7c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/23/sports/23nba-suns-lede/merlin_164829324_9a1b5546-56de-4a79-8cfb-33458d816d7c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/23/sports/23nba-suns-lede/merlin_164829324_9a1b5546-56de-4a79-8cfb-33458d816d7c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/23/sports/23nba-suns-lede/merlin_164829324_9a1b5546-56de-4a79-8cfb-33458d816d7c-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/23/sports/23nba-suns-lede/merlin_164829324_9a1b5546-56d