 Cooks”), Dorothy Wordsworth and Helen Gurley Brown, and the stories are wild — just a perfunctory glance at the summaries online revealed some things about Eleanor Roosevelt that I’d never have guessed. Revenge is a dish!", 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Variety: Acrostic', 'kicker': 'SUNDAY VARIETY COLUMN', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Poetry and Poets', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cox, Emily (Crossword Constructor)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rathvon, Henry', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Roosevelt, Eleanor', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-11-23T16:40:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Games', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'byline': {'original': 'By Caitlin Lovinger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Caitlin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lovinger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8241e2bd-170c-540c-975f-ce3d2f8a81b6', 'word_count': 301, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8241e2bd-170c-540c-975f-ce3d2f8a81b6'}, {'abstract': 'Readers discuss environmental, social and economic reasons that people worldwide are having fewer children — and what the effects will be.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/23/opinion/letters/birthrates-babies-population.html', 'snippet': 'Readers discuss environmental, social and economic reasons that people worldwide are having fewer children — and what the effects will be.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the Editor:', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/17/opinion/sunday/17Sussman/17Sussman-articleLarge.jpg', 