ould expect, we will make Zubin Mehta’s Indian lasagna — how can you have Thanksgiving without Indian lasagna?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/25/well/family/the-thanksgiving-traditionalists.html', 'snippet': 'As you would expect, we will make Zubin Mehta’s Indian lasagna — how can you have Thanksgiving without Indian lasagna?', 'lead_paragraph': 'My mother liked a loud (and, given our family, distinctly off-key) rendition of the hymn “We Gather Together” to kick off Thanksgiving dinner. The internet tells me it’s a Dutch Calvinist hymn of thanks for victory (in 1597) over Catholic Spain, so I’m not absolutely sure what it meant to my mother, who grew up in an Orthodox Jewish family in Brooklyn in the 1930s. Still, she taught us the one verse she knew, and we all obliged.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/25/well/25klass-2/25klass-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/25/well/25klass-2/25klass-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/25/well/25klass-2/25klass-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/25/well/25klass-2/25klass-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/25/well/25klass-2/25klass-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/25/well/25klass-2/25klass-2-thum