958-0801-50e8-abee-fb757057bd94'}, {'abstract': 'American political history suggests that an age of renewal lies ahead.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/25/opinion/trump-politics.html', 'snippet': 'American political history suggests that an age of renewal lies ahead.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As impeachment mania grips Washington, it is easy to descend into an ever-deepening political pessimism. But as odd as it may seem, for the first time in years, I’m optimistic about the future of American democracy. It might be because I’ve been reading more history and less news. And from the long arc of American political history, I see the bright flashing arrows of a new age of reform and renewal ahead.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/25/opinion/25drutman/merlin_150224205_f0264c59-aea4-4a55-a2ba-53076995202a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 385, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/25/opinion/25drutman/merlin_150224205_f0264c59-aea4-4a55-a2ba-53076995202a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 385}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/25/opinion/25drutman/merlin_150224205_f0264c59-aea4-4a55-a2ba-53076995202a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 657, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/25/opinion/25drutman/merlin_150224205_f0264c59-aea4-4a55-a2ba-53076995202a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1315, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/25/opinion/25drutman/merlin_150224205_f0264c59-aea4-4a55-a2ba-53076995202a-thumbStandard.jpg', 'h