{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prisoners of War', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANTI-SEMITISM', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bertelsmann AG', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Handelsblatt', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Austria', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Dachau (Germany)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Berger, Roland', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Berger, Georg', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-11-27T10:00:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jack Ewing', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jack', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ewing', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5ce2979a-6622-5c57-81da-f976c04946f4', 'word_count': 1500, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5ce2979a-6622-5c57-81da-f976c04946f4'}, {'abstract': 'He became America’s most reliable comic star without ever leaving his comfort zone. So what’s he doing in this year’s most anxiety-inducing film?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/27/magazine/adam-sandler-movies-uncut-gems.html', 'snippet': 'He became America’s most reliable comic star without ever leaving his comfort zone. So what’s he doing in this year’s most anxiety-inducing film?', 'lead_paragraph': 'We cruised down West Pico in Adam Sandler’s ride, a custom Chevy passenger van tricked out in the style of an orthopedic shoe. The cup holders jangled with suburban odds and ends — a pair of tiny glasses belonging to his daughter; a bottle of Dry-n-Clear ear drops. We were bound for Hillcrest Country Club, the oldest Jewish country club in Los Angeles. “You’re going to like this,” Sandler said. He whipped the van into the valet station. Alongside the row of town cars and coupes, it looked like an airport courtesy shuttle.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '36', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Adam Sandler’s Everlasting Shtick', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Everyman', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sandler, Adam', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Comedy and Humor', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Netflix Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ACTORS AND ACTRESSES', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-11-27T10:00:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jamie Lauren Keiles', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jamie', 'middlename': 'Lauren', 'lastname': 'Keiles', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c94f45ba-5479-5515-abec-1414dd9ccf70', 'word_count': 6995, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c94f45ba-5479-5515-abec-1414dd9ccf70'}, {'abstract': 'How a protest by students of color at Syracuse University — #NotAgainSU — electrified the campus and gained national attention.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/27/nyregion/syracuse-university-racism.html', 'snippet': 'How a protest by students of color at Syracuse University — #NotAgainSU — electrified the campus and gained national attention.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SYRACUSE, N.Y. — The racist graffiti was discovered one night this month on the sixth floor of a freshman dormitory at Syracuse University — an anti-black slur and the words “Little China Town” scrawled crudely in marker. The next day, similar messages were found on a four