orted', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/49b4f2c0-9ca9-5c5b-868c-d26697fa33b6', 'word_count': 1664, 'uri': 'nyt://article/49b4f2c0-9ca9-5c5b-868c-d26697fa33b6'}, {'abstract': '“I wouldn’t be surprised if there were hundreds of the same kind of people sitting in prison,” said Marilyn Mosby, Baltimore’s prosecutor, who created a unit to review old cases.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/27/us/baltimore-exonerations-states-attorney-marilyn-mosby.html', 'snippet': '“I wouldn’t be surprised if there were hundreds of the same kind of people sitting in prison,” said Marilyn Mosby, Baltimore’s prosecutor, who created a unit to review old cases.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Three men walked out of prison this week after serving 36 years for a murder that prosecutors now acknowledge they did not commit. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/27/us/27baltimore/27baltimore-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/27/us/27baltimore/27baltimore-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/27/us/27baltimore/27baltimore-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/27/us/27baltimore/27baltimore-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/27/us/27baltimore/27baltimore-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'su