ticle/dd3b10ff-11b5-5aa0-bd98-1583808102e8'}, {'abstract': 'Most of the victims were from a single family. “I am dead, I am finished, I am destroyed,” said one of the survivors.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/28/world/asia/afghan-wedding-bomb.html', 'snippet': 'Most of the victims were from a single family. “I am dead, I am finished, I am destroyed,” said one of the survivors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KABUL, Afghanistan — At least 13 people, most of them members of the same family, were killed this week when their car struck a roadside bomb on the way to a wedding party in northern Afghanistan, officials said.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Roadside Bomb Kills 13 People on Their Way to Afghan Wedding', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Blast Kills 13 on Way to Afghan Wedding', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kunduz (Afghanistan)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Improvised Explosive Devices', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Taliban', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civilian Casualties', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-11-28T11:36:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Fahim Abed and Najim Rahim', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Fahim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Abed', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Najim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rahim', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/25c1c34e-5306-51c7-bbf5-461349a77a19', 'word_count': 708, 'uri': 'nyt://article/25c1c34e-5306-51c7-bbf5-461349a77a19'}, {'abstract': 'Jayro Bustamante’s drama is vividly imagined, but lacks depth.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/28/movies/temblores-review.html', 'snippet': 'Jayro Bustamante’s drama is vividly imagined, but lacks depth.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Temblores” begins where other dramas of its ilk might end. On a rainy night in Guatemala City, the suave, wealthy Pablo (Juan Pablo Olyslager), a married father of two, comes home to find that his evangelical family has discovered his relationship with another man. After a histrionic confrontation, Pablo is evicted from the house.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/27/arts/temblores1/merlin_164868714_07c54b5b-465c-4cf2-9419-b18411ec07ea-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 300, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/27/arts/temblores1/merlin_164868714_07c54b5b-465c-4cf2-9419-b18411ec07ea-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 300}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/27/arts/temblores1/merlin_164868714_07c54b5b-465c-4cf2-9419-b18411ec07ea-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 512, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/27/arts/temblores1/merlin_164868714_07c54b5b-465c-4cf2-9419-b18411ec07ea-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1020, 'width': 2040, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/27/arts/temblores1/temblores1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbSt