//article/067e6851-8fe9-5b70-a04f-d6104fe8d1fa'}, {'abstract': 'Love is the answer, even when Romeo is a snake-catcher. Luckily, he’s not great at his job.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/28/movies/white-snake-review.html', 'snippet': 'Love is the answer, even when Romeo is a snake-catcher. Luckily, he’s not great at his job.', 'lead_paragraph': '“The Legend of the White Snake” is a famous Chinese folk tale that originated in the Ming dynasty. Its newest adaptation, the animation feature “White Snake,” which features a Disney-esque damsel-in-distress treatment, is a prequel, set 500 years before the main story.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/28/arts/28whitesnakepix/merlin_164868924_d890fbe1-dd4d-489f-8e56-89e799f9fe6e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 251, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/28/arts/28whitesnakepix/merlin_164868924_d890fbe1-dd4d-489f-8e56-89e799f9fe6e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 251}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/28/arts/28whitesnakepix/merlin_164868924_d890fbe1-dd4d-489f-8e56-89e799f9fe6e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 428, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/28/arts/28whitesnakepix/merlin_164868924_d890fbe1-dd4d-489f-8e56-89e799f9fe6e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 855, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/28/arts/28whitesnakepix/28whitesnakepix-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': '