bin’s youthful concerto.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/28/arts/music/daniil-trifonov-scriabin-philharmonic-review.html', 'snippet': 'Daniil Trifonov begins his artist-in-residence season at the New York Philharmonic with an exciting performance of Scriabin’s youthful concerto.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The 24-year-old Alexander Scriabin had completed his studies at the Moscow Conservatory but never written a work for orchestra when in a rush of enthusiasm in 1896, he composed his Piano Concerto in F sharp minor. (He never wrote another.)', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/29/arts/28nyphil/merlin_165136284_6b8d612a-8e58-49ac-af0b-aeb2cff4010b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/29/arts/28nyphil/merlin_165136284_6b8d612a-8e58-49ac-af0b-aeb2cff4010b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/29/arts/28nyphil/merlin_165136284_6b8d612a-8e58-49ac-af0b-aeb2cff4010b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/29/arts/28nyphil/merlin_165136284_6b8d612a-8e58-49ac-af0b-aeb2cff4010b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/29/arts/28nyphil/28nyphil-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/29/arts/28nyphil/28nyphil-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth':