nstitutions, all in Midtown, are close enough for a single afternoon’s tour (and with enough time in there for a bite).', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/28/arts/design/midtown-museums-Morgan-Library-and-Museum.html', 'snippet': 'These midsize institutions, all in Midtown, are close enough for a single afternoon’s tour (and with enough time in there for a bite).', 'lead_paragraph': 'You’ve shot your selfies in Rockefeller Center, you’ve combed the sale racks at Bloomingdale’s — and now you’re ready to discover the museums of New York like a proper local. Join me! I’ve got a plan to introduce you to three midsize institutions and one little diversion, all close enough for a single afternoon’s tour (and with enough time in there for a bite). We’ll be walking from 36th to 47th Streets, on the eastern stretches of Midtown Manhattan; this guide proceeds south to north, but it works just as well in the other direction. Check opening times before you go; Monday is a day off for most of these destinations, and hours can change around the holidays.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/29/arts/28critic-itenerary-morgan1/merlin_164853522_97563d85-c9d6-420f-8010-9a6fcc5ef9b3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 402, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/29/arts/28critic-itenerary-morgan1/merlin_164853522_97563d85-c9d6-420f-8010-9a6fcc5ef9b3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 402}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/29/arts/28critic-itenerary-morgan1/merlin_164853522_97563d85-c9d6-420f-8010-9a6fcc5ef9b3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 687, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': Non