d a larger global role for Japan and was one of the few Japanese leaders to win recognition on the world stage.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/28/obituaries/yasuhiro-nakasone-dies-japan.html', 'snippet': 'He called for a stronger military and a larger global role for Japan and was one of the few Japanese leaders to win recognition on the world stage.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Yasuhiro Nakasone, the former prime minister of Japan who entered politics during the post-World War II American occupation of his country and spent the rest of his career championing the re-emergence of a more assertive and independent nation, died on Friday in Tokyo. He was 101.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/30/world/00nakasone1/merlin_165172572_39e85d10-62c2-45be-b2ca-0b9391e6687f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/11/30/world/00nakasone1/merlin_165172572_39e85d10-62c2-45be-b2ca-0b9391e6687f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/30/world/00nakasone1/merlin_165172572_39e85d10-62c2-45be-b2ca-0b9391e6687f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/30/world/00nakasone1/merlin_165172572_39e85d10-62c2-45be-b2ca-0b9391e6687f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/30/world/00nakasone1/00nakasone1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/11/30/world/00nakasone1/00nakasone1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/11/30/world/00nakasone1/00nakasone1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Yasuhiro Nakasone, Assertive Prime Minister of Japan, Dies at 101', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Yasuhiro Nakasone, Assertive Prime Minister of Japan, Is Dead at 101', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nakasone, Yasuhiro', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Japan', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2019-11-29T04:59:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Obits', 'section_name': 'Obituaries', 'byline': {'original': 'By Norimitsu Onishi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Norimitsu', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Onishi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/0dc06ccb-97dc-56bc-a405-451ee385d849', 'word_count': 955, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0dc06ccb-97dc-56bc-a405-451ee385d849'}, {'abstract': 'The loss of a loved one can complicate family math.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/29/style/modern-love-a-family-isnt-a-number.html', 'snippet': 'The loss of a loved one can complicate family math.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When my son was in third grade, I went to his school for a pre-Thanksgiving Day concert. I found a folding chair next to a fellow parent, a father with an easy laugh. We made small talk, looked over and