ng their art to fit into smaller spaces.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/29/realestate/artists-working-from-home.html', 'snippet': 'As rents for studios and lofts rise, many young artists find themselves working from home and adjusting their art to fit into smaller spaces.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Erin Lorek is an artist whose practice involves casting sheets of glass using large iron plates, work that would ideally be done in a concrete-floored, industrial warehouse with a freight elevator, rather than the living room of a shared, three-bedroom apartment in a Bedford-Stuyvesant brownstone.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/01/realestate/29artists01/merlin_164685258_9e3f3300-89bd-4cbe-8631-57bc7d87aa07-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/01/realestate/29artists01/merlin_164685258_9e3f3300-89bd-4cbe-8631-57bc7d87aa07-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/01/realestate/29artists01/merlin_164685258_9e3f3300-89bd-4cbe-8631-57bc7d87aa07-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/01/realestate/29artists01/merlin_164685258_9e3f3300-89bd-4cbe-8631-57bc7d87aa07-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/01/realestate/29artists01/merlin_164685258_9e3f3300-89bd-4cbe-8631-57bc7d87aa07-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 't