, or make a lemony turmeric cake instead.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2019/11/29/dining/the-best-leftovers-recipes.html', 'snippet': 'Use up that turkey in an enchilada pie, or make a lemony turmeric cake instead.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good morning. The adrenaline wore off at about the same time the turkey kicked in yesterday, and then there was a long walk in the cold before a glass of bourbon and a slice of pie. Cued up “The Paper” on the big screen in the den and was asleep before Michael Keaton arrives at The Sentinel for his big interview with Spalding Gray. I hope it went as swimmingly for you, that there was moist turkey or squash, endless dessert, great conversation, good football, no head injuries.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/01/magazine/01mag-eat-copy/01mag-eat-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2019/12/01/magazine/01mag-eat-copy/01mag-eat-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/01/magazine/01mag-eat-copy/01mag-eat-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/01/magazine/01mag-eat-copy/01mag-eat-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2019/12/01/magazine/01mag-eat-copy/01mag-eat-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2019/12/01/magazine/01mag-eat-copy/01mag-eat-thumbStandard.jpg', '